{"reviewId": "426066534_8cT6Z9odJ", "review": {"abstract": "但是必须指出，这类高通胀之后伴随着油价的下跌，在一到两个季度内实际GDP将出现低点，相关内容详见我们的报告《通胀演绎经济底部开端》。而且，我们的例证表明，这个实际GDP的低点就是长波的最低点。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterUid": 10, "content": "资源价格导致主导国ppi见顶，资源约束经济增长达到最大效果，随后ppi回落，全球需求下降，极度萎缩，gdp最低点，接着就是随着资源价格下跌带来的ppi回升\n\n从某种程度来说，资源价格就是长波最直观的外在表现", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "14483-14579", "createTime": 1792110633, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 10, "reviewId": "426066534_8cT6Z9odJ", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1792110849, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "认同。这也对应了前文提到的美国每月核心CPI指标在判断世界经济形势方面的重要性。核心CPI不断抬高，美联储就会通过加息降低通胀，资源品价格（大宗商品）就会随之走低。", "reviewId": "426066534_8cT6Z9odJ", "commentId": "426066534_8cT6Z9odJ_c547403852_8cYa7z29u", "userVid": 547403852, "createTime": 1792397507, "author": {"userVid": 547403852, "name": "尼克", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKe4DjQWeXKdbMl08GzPgDsPmpDU2RTs8RuhHQHOlNYGHcVRlWqdSlmWCicIh1NOTdich7KU7akMHHQ/132", "is